 ['purpose','Why was the sunrise story retained on the sign?',['To distinguish later tradition from documented practice','Tradisi dapat dijelaskan tanpa disamakan dengan bukti sezaman.'],[['To declare all written evidence unreliable','Komite justru mengikuti bukti tertulis.'],['To conceal the reason for the chosen hour','Tanda menjelaskan keputusan.'],['To replace the bell with a clock','Tidak ada penggantian bell.']],'included as a later tradition rather than erased','Mengakui perubahan makna sejarah.']
