 ['purpose','Why are old paths mentioned?',['They provide evidence of another possible human influence','Jalan lama mengisyaratkan pengumpulan bahan bakar.'],[['They show the best route for current tourists','Bukan petunjuk arah wisata.'],['They identify the exact date each shrub grew','Tidak menentukan tanggal tumbuh setiap semak.'],['They disprove all grazing records','Tidak membantah catatan penggembalaan.']],'people had collected fuel near the former boundary','Contoh menambah faktor yang perlu dipertimbangkan.']
