 ['purpose','Why include descriptions of actual meetings?',['To compare labels with evidence of how the council worked','Deskripsi kegiatan membantu menilai pilihan istilah.'],[['To avoid considering either written version','Kedua versi tetap ditampilkan berdampingan.'],['To prove the translator attended every meeting','Tidak menyebut penerjemah menghadiri pertemuan.'],['To replace the diary with a modern election manual','Tidak ada panduan pemilu modern.']],'both versions alongside descriptions of actual council meetings','Catatan praktik membantu memeriksa label konsep.']
